  "title": "主工具栏",
  "html": "<html><head></head><body><div>\n  <h1>主工具栏</h1>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\">Aras Innovator 的用户界面在主窗口、弹出窗口和其他对话框中提供工具栏图标。</p>\n  <p class=\"Content_body_indented\"><img src=\"/aras-images/maintoolbar1.jpg\"></p>\n  <!--?rh-list_start level=\"1\" an=\"1\" class=\"rl-p-Figure_indented\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n    \n    <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n      <p class=\"Content_body\">下表描述了主工具栏中的图标。</p>\n      <table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"Aras_Blue\" style=\"left: 0px; top: 64px;\" width=\"912\">\n        <colgroup>\n          <col style=\"width: 17.839%;\">\n          <col style=\"width: 13.663%;\">\n          <col style=\"width: 68.498%;\">\n        </colgroup>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr class=\"t1st\">\n            <td style=\"border: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n              <p class=\"Table_header\">按钮名称</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"border-top: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n              <p class=\"Table_header\">按钮</p>\n            </td>\n            <td colspan=\"1\" style=\"border-top: 1px solid rgb(192, 192, 192); border-right: 1px solid rgb(192, 192, 192); border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(192, 192, 192); width: 218px;\">\n              <p class=\"Table_header\">说明</p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n              <p class=\"Table_Body\">编辑</p>\n              \n            </td>\n            <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\"><img src=\"/aras-images/edit.jpg\"></td>\n            <td colspan=\"1\" style=\"border-right: 1px solid rgb(192, 192, 192); border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(192, 192, 192); width: 218px;\">打开条目进行编辑。</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n              <p class=\"Table_Body\">保存</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n              <p class=\"Table_Body\"><img src=\"/aras-images/save.jpg\"></p>\n            </td>\n            <td colspan=\"1\" style=\"border-right: 1px solid rgb(192, 192, 192); border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(192, 192, 192); width: 218px;\">\n              <p class=\"Table_Body\">保存对条目的更改。条目保持在编辑模式。</p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n              <p class=\"Table_Body\">完成</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n              <p class=\"Table_Body\"><img src=\"/aras-images/done.jpg\"></p>\n            </td>\n            <td colspan=\"1\" style=\"border-right: 1px solid rgb(192, 192, 192); border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(192, 192, 192); width: 218px;\">\n              <p class=\"Table_Body\">保存条目并取消认领。</p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n              <p class=\"Table_Body\">放弃</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n              <p class=\"Table_Body\"><img src=\"/aras-images/Discard.jpg\"></p>\n            </td>\n            <td colspan=\"1\" style=\"border-right: 1px solid rgb(192, 192, 192); border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(192, 192, 192); width: 218px;\">\n              <p class=\"Table_Body\">放弃对条目的更改。条目返回到查看模式并取消认领。</p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n              <p class=\"Table_Body\">刷新</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n              <p class=\"Table_Body\"><img src=\"/aras-images/refresh.jpg\"></p>\n            </td>\n            <td colspan=\"1\" style=\"border-right: 1px solid rgb(192, 192, 192); border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(192, 192, 192); width: 218px;\">\n              <p class=\"Table_Body\">刷新屏幕。</p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n              <p class=\"Table_Body\">提升</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n              <p class=\"Table_Body\"><img src=\"/aras-images/promote.jpg\"></p>\n            </td>\n            <td colspan=\"1\" style=\"border-right: 1px solid rgb(192, 192, 192); border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(192, 192, 192); width: 218px;\">\n              <p class=\"Table_Body\">允许将条目提升到下一级别。</p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n              <p class=\"Table_Body\">导航</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n              <p class=\"Table_Body\"><img src=\"/aras-images/navigate.jpg\"></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"border-right: 1px solid rgb(192, 192, 192); border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(192, 192, 192); width: 218px;\">\n              <p class=\"Table_Body\">显示以下菜单：</p>\n              <p class=\"Table_Body\"><img src=\"/aras-images/navmenu.jpg\"></p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n      <table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"Aras_Blue\" style=\"left: 0px; top: 64px;\" width=\"912\">\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"border-left: 1px solid rgb(192, 192, 192); border-right: 1px solid rgb(192, 192, 192); border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(192, 192, 192); width: 148px;\">\n              <p class=\"Table_Body\">报表</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"border-right: 1px solid rgb(192, 192, 192); border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(192, 192, 192); width: 109px;\">\n              <p class=\"Table_Body\"><img src=\"/aras-images/reports.jpg\"></p>\n            </td>\n            <td colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-right: 1px solid rgb(192, 192, 192); border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(192, 192, 192); width: 611px;\">\n              <p class=\"Table_Body\">显示以下菜单：</p>\n              <p class=\"Table_Body\"><img src=\"/aras-images/reportsmenu.jpg\"></p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"border-left: 1px solid rgb(192, 192, 192); border-right: 1px solid rgb(192, 192, 192); border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(192, 192, 192); width: 148px;\">\n              <p class=\"Table_Body\">共享</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"border-right: 1px solid rgb(192, 192, 192); border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(192, 192, 192); width: 109px;\">\n              <p class=\"Table_Body\"><img src=\"/aras-images/share.jpg\"></p>\n            </td>\n            <td colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-right: 1px solid rgb(192, 192, 192); border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(192, 192, 192); width: 611px;\">\n              <p class=\"Table_Body\">显示以下菜单：</p>\n              <p class=\"Table_Body\"><img src=\"/aras-images/sharemenu.jpg\"></p>\n              \n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"border-left: 1px solid rgb(192, 192, 192); border-right: 1px solid rgb(192, 192, 192); border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(192, 192, 192); width: 148px;\">\n              <p class=\"Table_Body\">更多</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"border-right: 1px solid rgb(192, 192, 192); border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(192, 192, 192); width: 109px;\">\n             